---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../styles/demo.css';
import Seed from '../../components/demos/Seed.astro';
---
<Base
  title="How a seed is born — watch one get created · BitcoinKeys.guide"
  description="A safe, step-by-step demonstration of how a Bitcoin seed phrase is generated — from raw randomness to 12 words to your first address. A throwaway seed, generated in your browser. No input box, on purpose."
  verified="2026-07-31"
>
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive demo · try it yourself</p>
    <h1>Watch a seed <span class="accent">get born</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      You've read that <a href="/learn/bitcoin-keys">your seed words <em>are</em> your key</a>. This page shows
      you <em>how</em> — a real seed phrase built in front of you, one step at a time, from pure randomness
      to 12 words to a Bitcoin address.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section>
    <Seed />
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="label">The takeaway</span>
      <p style="margin:0">
        A seed phrase isn't assigned by a company — it's just an enormous random number, rewritten as words so
        a human can copy it. The <em>same words always rebuild the same wallet</em>, on any brand of device.
        That's why the words are the backup, and why guarding them is the whole game.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/learn/bitcoin-keys">← Back to how it all works</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/demos/typo">See the checksum catch a typo →</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/learn/back-up-your-seed">How to back yours up →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .demo { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface); padding: 1.6rem 1.4rem; margin: 1.4rem 0; }
  .intro { text-align: center; }
  .intro-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0.3rem 0 1.2rem; }
  .btn-go { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent); border: none; border-radius: 0.6rem; padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; }
  .btn-go:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
  .btn-go:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: default; }
  .intro-note { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 0.9rem 0 0; }

  .step-top { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .step-count { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.76rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .step-count b { color: var(--accent); }
  .step-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .step-body { min-height: 8rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .step-cap { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 1.1rem 0 0; max-width: 52ch; }
  .step-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.3rem; }
  .btn-nav { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem; }
  .btn-nav:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .btn-nav:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; }
  .btn-nav.next { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .dots { display: flex; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .dot { width: 0.5rem; height: 0.5rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--line); }
  .dot.on { background: var(--accent); }
  .btn-regen { display: block; margin: 1.1rem auto 0; background: none; border: none; color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-regen:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.7rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.65rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .btn.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
</style>

